 help with the with the  crisis but they haven't you know we have  said obviously that there should be a  windfall tax with the with the company  you know with it with the with the fuel  companies the energy companies they  don't seem to have been able to focus on  that i mean it's a really really good  idea and it would help you know every  family 600 pounds  well you know the  political parties have stolen good ideas  from each other since we were welcomed  and we would welcome it let them steal  it but they won't even do that emily  thornfield thanks for joining us

